// abnf/jsrtjvm.go's jvmFloText sends floGo to goFloStr, and the interpreter half
// reaches the same code.

// ================================= float32: the 32 BIT WIDTH ================
//
// Go's float32 is a tag 14 box of style 4 (floGoF in abnf/jsrtjvm.go); the
